  "notes": "moedu.gov.iq could not be reached. Archived ministry news confirms the stage names and الأول الابتدائي, السادس الابتدائي, الثالث المتوسط and السادس الإعدادي. The statistics authority's primary (2021/2022) and secondary (2023/2024) education reports, prepared with the ministry, count pupils in each primary grade, in the first to third intermediate grades, and in the fourth to sixth years of the preparatory stage (scientific and literary). Kurdistan Region schools use a 9-year basic stage (grades 1-9) plus grades 10-12."
